{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "Clinic Booking API",
        "description": "\n### Clinic Booking API Developer Guide\n\nWelcome to the **Clinic Booking API**. This service enables client applications to discover doctor appointment slots, book appointments with robust concurrency safety, and manage booking lifecycles.\n\n---\n\n### Core Architectural Features\n\n1. **Authentication**:\n   - All endpoints require an **`X-API-Key`** header.\n   - Invalid or missing API keys immediately result in `401 Unauthorized`.\n\n2. **Atomic Concurrency Control**:\n   - Appointment slots are protected against double-booking using pessimistic row-level locking.\n   - If multiple patients attempt to book the same slot simultaneously, exactly one reservation succeeds (`201 Created`) and subsequent contenders receive `409 Conflict`.\n\n3. **Safe Retries with Idempotency**:\n   - Pass an **`Idempotency-Key`** header with `POST /bookings` to safely retry requests over unstable network connections without duplicate charges or bookings.\n   - Repeating a request with the same key and payload returns the identical response.\n   - Changing the payload under an active key returns `422 Unprocessable Entity`.\n\n4. **Sliding-Window Rate Limiting**:\n   - Booking creation is throttled to **5 attempts per minute per email**.\n   - The 6th attempt returns `429 Too Many Requests` along with a **`Retry-After`** header indicating the number of seconds to wait.\n\n5. **Cursor-Based Pagination**:\n   - `GET /bookings` uses stable, URL-safe cursor tokens ordered chronologically (oldest first).\n   - Use `next_cursor` from the response to fetch the subsequent page until `next_cursor` is `null`.\n\n6. **Unified Error Contract**:\n   - All errors adhere to a consistent JSON envelope:\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"error\": \"Descriptive error message\"\n     }\n     ```\n",
        "version": "1.0"
    },
    "paths": {
        "/reset": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Reset"
                ],
                "summary": "Reset schedule and administrative state",
                "description": "Replace all slots, delete all bookings, and reset rate limits and idempotency state.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nUse this administrative endpoint during testing, automated CI/CD runs, or environment setup to establish a clean schedule state.\n\n- **Wipes Database**: Purges all existing booking records and existing slot definitions.\n- **Seeds New Slots**: Populates the clinic timetable with the provided `slots` array (past dates are accepted for historical seeding).\n- **Flushes Redis**: Resets sliding-window rate limit counters and cached idempotency keys immediately.\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/reset\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"slots\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"s1\",\n        \"provider\": \"Dr Ade\",\n        \"start\": \"2026-12-10T09:00:00Z\",\n        \"end\": \"2026-12-10T09:30:00Z\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"s2\",\n        \"provider\": \"Dr Ade\",\n        \"start\": \"2026-12-10T10:00:00Z\",\n        \"end\": \"2026-12-10T10:30:00Z\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }'\n```",
                "operationId": "reset_slots_reset_post",
                "requestBody": {
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResetSlotsRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "All slots replaced, existing bookings deleted, and cache counters cleared.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "additionalProperties": {
                                        "type": "string"
                                    },
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "title": "Response Reset Slots Reset Post"
                                },
                                "example": {
                                    "status": "ok"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Invalid request payload or malformed slot timestamps.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Field cannot be empty"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/slots": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Slots"
                ],
                "summary": "List appointment slots with real-time availability",
                "description": "Retrieve appointment slots sorted by earliest start time first.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nCall this endpoint before presenting scheduling options to patients.\n\n- **Availability Flag**: Each slot contains an `available` boolean (`true` if open, `false` if already reserved by a confirmed booking).\n- **Chronological Sorting**: Slots are returned in ascending chronological order (`start` ASC, `id` ASC).\n- **Provider Filtering**: Provide `?provider=<name>` to retrieve slots tailored to a specific doctor or clinic practitioner.\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"http://localhost:8000/slots?provider=Dr%20Ade\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\"\n```",
                "operationId": "list_slots_slots_get",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "provider",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "anyOf": [
                                {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "null"
                                }
                            ],
                            "description": "Filter slots by exact provider name (e.g., 'Dr Ade'). Omit to list slots across all practitioners.",
                            "examples": [
                                "Dr Ade"
                            ],
                            "title": "Provider"
                        },
                        "description": "Filter slots by exact provider name (e.g., 'Dr Ade'). Omit to list slots across all practitioners."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successfully retrieved slots with current booking availability.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SlotListResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/bookings": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Bookings"
                ],
                "summary": "Reserve an appointment slot",
                "description": "Reserve an appointment slot for a patient with built-in concurrency safety.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nUse this endpoint to book a doctor consultation slot retrieved from `GET /slots`.\n\n- **Concurrency & Race Conditions**: Uses pessimistic database row locks (`SELECT FOR UPDATE`). When multiple clients attempt to book the exact same slot concurrently, exactly one succeeds (`201`) and all others receive `409 Conflict`.\n- **Safe Retries (Idempotency)**: Include an `Idempotency-Key` header with a client-generated UUID. If network drops occur, replay the exact same request safely; the server will return the previously cached response without re-executing booking logic. Sending the same key with altered payload fields returns `422 Unprocessable Entity`.\n- **Sliding-Window Rate Limiting**: Capped at **5 booking attempts per email per minute** (both successful and failed requests count). Exceeding this limit returns `429 Too Many Requests` accompanied by a `Retry-After: <seconds>` HTTP header.\n- **Data Normalization**: Patient name and email are trimmed of surrounding whitespace; emails are normalized to lowercase. Past slots are rejected with `400 Bad Request`.\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n- `Idempotency-Key` *(Optional)*: Recommended for production retry resilience.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/bookings\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: 9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"slot_id\": \"s1\",\n    \"name\": \"Ada Obi\",\n    \"email\": \"ada@example.com\"\n  }'\n```",
                "operationId": "create_booking_bookings_post",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "Idempotency-Key",
                        "in": "header",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "anyOf": [
                                {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "null"
                                }
                            ],
                            "description": "Optional unique identifier (e.g., UUIDv4) for safe retries without duplicate bookings.",
                            "examples": [
                                "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d"
                            ],
                            "title": "Idempotency-Key"
                        },
                        "description": "Optional unique identifier (e.g., UUIDv4) for safe retries without duplicate bookings."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "201": {
                        "description": "Booking created successfully with status 'confirmed'.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Validation error: Missing or empty fields, malformed email, or slot has already started.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Slot has already started"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "The specified slot_id was not found in the clinic database.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Slot not found"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "409": {
                        "description": "Concurrency Conflict: Slot already has an active confirmed booking.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Slot is already booked"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Idempotency Mismatch: Idempotency-Key header was previously used with a different request body.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Idempotency key reused with different payload"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "description": "Rate Limit Exceeded: Exceeded 5 booking attempts per minute for this email.",
                        "headers": {
                            "Retry-After": {
                                "description": "Number of seconds to wait before retrying",
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "integer",
                                    "example": 45
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Rate limit exceeded. Try again in 45 seconds"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "description": "Patient booking reservation payload.",
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "slot_id",
                                    "name",
                                    "email"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "slot_id": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Unique identifier of the appointment slot to reserve",
                                        "example": "s1"
                                    },
                                    "name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Full name of the patient (whitespace will be trimmed)",
                                        "example": "Ada Obi"
                                    },
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email",
                                        "description": "Valid patient email address (case-insensitive, stored lowercase)",
                                        "example": "ada@example.com"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "examples": {
                                "standard_booking": {
                                    "summary": "Sample Patient Booking",
                                    "value": {
                                        "slot_id": "s1",
                                        "name": "Ada Obi",
                                        "email": "ada@example.com"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Bookings"
                ],
                "summary": "List patient bookings with cursor pagination",
                "description": "Retrieve chronological bookings for a patient using stable cursor pagination.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nUse this endpoint to view a patient's booking history (both `confirmed` and `cancelled`).\n\n- **Cursor Pagination Loop**:\n  1. First page: Call `GET /bookings?email=patient@example.com&limit=10`.\n  2. If `next_cursor` is present, fetch next page with `GET /bookings?email=patient@example.com&limit=10&cursor=<next_cursor>`.\n  3. When `next_cursor` is `null`, you have reached the end of the history.\n- **Chronological Ordering**: Items are always sorted oldest first (`created_at` ASC, `id` ASC).\n- **Case-Insensitive Filter**: Email matching ignores case differences (`Ada@Example.com` matches `ada@example.com`).\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"http://localhost:8000/bookings?email=ada@example.com&limit=10\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\"\n```",
                "operationId": "list_bookings_bookings_get",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "email",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "anyOf": [
                                {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "null"
                                }
                            ],
                            "description": "Patient email address (required, matched case-insensitively).",
                            "examples": [
                                "ada@example.com"
                            ],
                            "title": "Email"
                        },
                        "description": "Patient email address (required, matched case-insensitively)."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "description": "Number of bookings to retrieve per page (integer between 1 and 50).",
                            "examples": [
                                10
                            ],
                            "default": 10,
                            "title": "Limit"
                        },
                        "description": "Number of bookings to retrieve per page (integer between 1 and 50)."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "cursor",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "anyOf": [
                                {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "null"
                                }
                            ],
                            "description": "Opaque base64 cursor token received from `next_cursor` of the previous page response.",
                            "examples": [
                                "MjAyNi0xMC0yOVQxMTowMDowMFp8Yl9hMWIyYzNkNGU1ZjY="
                            ],
                            "title": "Cursor"
                        },
                        "description": "Opaque base64 cursor token received from `next_cursor` of the previous page response."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Page of bookings matching patient email returned successfully.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginatedBookingsResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Missing email query parameter, invalid limit (must be 1–50), or invalid cursor format.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "email query parameter is required"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/bookings/{id}": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Bookings"
                ],
                "summary": "Retrieve booking details",
                "description": "Retrieve full details of a specific booking by its identifier.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nUse this endpoint to verify booking details or confirm cancellation status.\n\n- **Status Values**: The `status` field indicates whether the booking is currently active (`confirmed`) or was cancelled (`cancelled`).\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"http://localhost:8000/bookings/b_a1b2c3d4e5f6\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\"\n```",
                "operationId": "get_booking_bookings__id__get",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Unique identifier of the booking reservation (e.g., 'b_a1b2c3d4e5f6').",
                            "examples": [
                                "b_a1b2c3d4e5f6"
                            ],
                            "title": "Id"
                        },
                        "description": "Unique identifier of the booking reservation (e.g., 'b_a1b2c3d4e5f6')."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Booking details retrieved successfully.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "No booking was found matching the provided id.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "No booking with that id"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "delete": {
                "tags": [
                    "Bookings"
                ],
                "summary": "Cancel a booking and release slot",
                "description": "Cancel an active booking and release its appointment slot for other patients.\n\n### How to leverage this endpoint:\nUse this endpoint when a patient cancels or reschedules their appointment.\n\n- **Immediate Slot Release**: Sets the booking's `status` to `cancelled` and instantly makes its associated slot available (`available: true`) for booking via `POST /bookings`.\n- **Cancellation Guard**: Attempting to delete a booking that is already cancelled returns `409 Conflict`.\n\n#### Required Headers:\n- `X-API-Key`: Your configured clinic API secret key.\n\n#### Example cURL:\n```bash\ncurl -X DELETE \"http://localhost:8000/bookings/b_a1b2c3d4e5f6\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: secret123\"\n```",
                "operationId": "cancel_booking_bookings__id__delete",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "APIKeyHeader": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Unique identifier of the booking reservation to cancel.",
                            "examples": [
                                "b_a1b2c3d4e5f6"
                            ],
                            "title": "Id"
                        },
                        "description": "Unique identifier of the booking reservation to cancel."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Booking successfully cancelled and slot released back to available inventory.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid X-API-Key header.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Missing or invalid API key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "No booking was found matching the provided id.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "No booking with that id"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "409": {
                        "description": "Conflict: This booking has already been cancelled previously.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "example": {
                                    "error": "Booking is already cancelled"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "schemas": {
            "BookingResponse": {
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Id",
                        "description": "Unique identifier generated for this booking reservation",
                        "examples": [
                            "b_a1b2c3d4e5f6"
                        ]
                    },
                    "slot_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Slot Id",
                        "description": "Identifier of the reserved slot",
                        "examples": [
                            "s1"
                        ]
                    },
                    "name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Name",
                        "description": "Patient name associated with the reservation",
                        "examples": [
                            "Ada Obi"
                        ]
                    },
                    "email": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Email",
                        "description": "Normalized lower-case patient email address",
                        "examples": [
                            "ada@example.com"
                        ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "confirmed",
                            "cancelled"
                        ],
                        "title": "Status",
                        "description": "Current status of the reservation ('confirmed' or 'cancelled')",
                        "examples": [
                            "confirmed"
                        ]
                    },
                    "created_at": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Created At",
                        "description": "UTC creation timestamp in ISO-8601 format",
                        "examples": [
                            "2026-10-29T11:00:00Z"
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "id",
                    "slot_id",
                    "name",
                    "email",
                    "status",
                    "created_at"
                ],
                "title": "BookingResponse",
                "description": "Response DTO representing a clinic booking.",
                "example": {
                    "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:00:00Z",
                    "email": "ada@example.com",
                    "id": "b_a1b2c3d4e5f6",
                    "name": "Ada Obi",
                    "slot_id": "s1",
                    "status": "confirmed"
                }
            },
            "HTTPValidationError": {
                "properties": {
                    "detail": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Detail"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "title": "HTTPValidationError"
            },
            "PaginatedBookingsResponse": {
                "properties": {
                    "bookings": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingResponse"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Bookings",
                        "description": "List of patient bookings on the current page, sorted chronologically (oldest first)"
                    },
                    "next_cursor": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Next Cursor",
                        "description": "Opaque base64 cursor token to request the subsequent page. Evaluates to null on the terminal page.",
                        "examples": [
                            "MjAyNi0xMC0yOVQxMTowMDowMFp8Yl9hMWIyYzNkNGU1ZjY="
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "bookings"
                ],
                "title": "PaginatedBookingsResponse",
                "description": "Response DTO for cursor-paginated bookings list.",
                "example": {
